        "file": "test-cases/eslint-snippets/fixture/executor-library-package/controls.ts",
        "line": 37,
        "message": "This adapter hides write from SQL analysis (arity or rest). Call the executor on the SQL text (`write(sql)`, or `const exec = write; exec(sql)`). `queryDynamic(column, write)` is not a judged rewrite: analysis does not follow an executor passed as a value. Write the direct call explicitly. Analysis cannot check SQL that only reaches the executor through this adapter.",
